    "method_label_implementation_mismatch": "The retained visibility_method string says calibrated_projection_and_obb_occlusion, but the implementation stores axis-aligned min/max bounds and tests only each target-center ray against the other two retained movable-object AABBs. The label is not treated as proof of OBB, silhouette, robot/static-scene, RGB or general occlusion analysis.",
