    "verified_implementation": "For each of banana, bowl and rubiks_cube, the pinned adapter obtains world.get_bbox corners, converts them to numeric rows, and stores the per-axis minima/maxima as a robot-base axis-aligned box before the camera loop. This audit projects only the eight corners of that retained AABB."
